{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The girls are about to embark on a road trip...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you press a key, your car gains momentum. Reach a destination, and you\u2019ll unlock a new vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether working, studying, or gaming... every keystroke helps the girls unlock new maps and continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to ride? Let\u2019s go!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to choose and unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u5fa1\u4e09\u5bb6.jpg?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of cars to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u8be6\u60c53.jpg?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u8be6\u60c54.jpg?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrive at world-famous cities and collect city postcards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u8be6\u60c52.jpg?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u8be6\u60c51.jpg?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No extra effort needed\u2014just type and click as usual on your computer, and the car will drive automatically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/\u6c7d\u8f66\u6253\u5b57.png?t=1751432207\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Car Drop Rates</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bronze Chest:</strong> 87% Bronze, 8% Silver, 4.9999% Gold, 0.0001% Diamond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silver Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Silver or above compared to Bronze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gold Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Gold or above compared to Silver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diamond Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Diamond compared to Gold</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Relaxing gameplay<br>\u2714 A wide variety of cars<br>\u2714 Easy way to collect rare vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [F4] to hide the interface and enter game mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828520?t=1751432207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/0974365ad44ac3d5384cf4f8cfc13a15f37828e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751432207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/587d2bad5aec0ea579e26291afd51271da33ffe7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751432207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama